// HZM coop - WOUNDED BREATHING aliases (coop_mod/wounded.scr).
//
// Same source the DBNO breath stages use - sound/characters/gasmask*.wav is retail laboured
// breathing - but pitched down and quieter, so being wounded is audibly a LESSER state than being
// downed rather than the same cue at the same level. stage 2 is slower and heavier than stage 1.
//
// Played through playlocalsound as a 2D PER-CLIENT LOOP, so only the wounded player hears their own
// breathing; teammates never do. minDist/maxDist are therefore close to irrelevant, but are kept
// sane in case a future caller plays one positionally.
//
// aliascache, not alias: these must be precached into the gamestate. A plain alias registers lazily
// at first play, which arrives as a post-gamestate reliable command - the bug-1183 disconnect class.
// The maps list is a PREFIX match and covers the whole trilogy; `always` alone would resolve the
// name but would NOT precache, because CacheResource is separately gated on bLoadForMap.

aliascache coop_wound_breath1 sound/characters/gasmask1.wav soundparms 0.62 0.0 0.92 0.0 320 2200 item loaded always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"
aliascache coop_wound_breath2 sound/characters/gasmask2.wav soundparms 0.78 0.0 0.84 0.0 320 2200 item loaded always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"
